            {'text':'Riders should only call after they receive a match notice.','task':'Move only to show that the timing, not the action, is limited.','choices':['Only riders should call after they receive a match notice.','Riders should call only after they receive a match notice.','Riders only should call after they receive a match notice.','Riders should call after only they receive a match notice.'],'answer':'B. Riders should call only after they receive a match notice.','why':'Only directly limits the after-clause.'},
