            {'text':'Walking through the lobby, the new signs were easy to see.','task':'Choose the logical revision.','choices':['Walking through the lobby, visitors could easily see the new signs.','Walking through the lobby, the new signs were easy to see.','The signs, walking through the lobby, were easy to see.','Walking, the lobby showed signs.'],'answer':'A. Walking through the lobby, visitors could easily see the new signs.','why':'Visitors, not signs, can walk through the lobby.'},
