            {'text':'Using the updated map, the detour was easier for drivers to follow.','task':'Choose the best revision.','choices':['Using the updated map, drivers could follow the detour more easily.','Using the updated map, the detour was easier for drivers to follow.','The map used the drivers to follow the detour.','Using the detour, the map followed the drivers.'],'answer':'A. Using the updated map, drivers could follow the detour more easily.','why':'Drivers are the users of the map, so they must follow the opening phrase.'},
            {'text':'The lab nearly recorded every temperature reading.','task':'Choose the revision meaning all readings were recorded and their values were close to each other.','choices':['The lab recorded nearly every temperature reading.','The lab recorded every temperature reading, and the values were nearly the same.','Nearly the lab recorded every temperature reading.','The lab nearly recorded every temperature reading.'],'answer':'B. The lab recorded every temperature reading, and the values were nearly the same.','why':'The original nearly modifies recorded and suggests the recording almost happened. The revision states the intended two ideas explicitly.'},
            {'text':'Before approving the schedule, the staffing levels were reviewed.','task':'Choose the clearest revision.','choices':['Before approving the schedule, the director reviewed the staffing levels.','Before approving the schedule, the staffing levels were reviewed.','The staffing levels approved the schedule after review.','Before approval, reviewing staffing levels was scheduled.'],'answer':'A. Before approving the schedule, the director reviewed the staffing levels.','why':'The director is now clearly the person who approves and reviews.'},
